WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:34.985 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:43.305 --> 01:44.265
Your Ladyship.

5
01:44.345 --> 01:45.705
There's been a murder at the estate.

6
01:45.785 --> 01:47.505
We should turn the suspect over to the authorities.

7
01:47.585 --> 01:50.185
Even if we question the suspect, vigilante justice is not permitted.

8
01:50.265 --> 01:51.345
Why not?

9
01:54.985 --> 01:57.385
Your Ladyship, this is your land.

10
01:57.465 --> 01:58.105
AS THE SUN RISES

11
01:58.185 --> 01:59.905
Even the local officials need your permission

12
02:00.545 --> 02:02.145
before they can arrest a suspect here.

13
02:02.745 --> 02:06.025
Feng Sheng, what if you hand over the suspect

14
02:06.105 --> 02:07.905
and someone kills him to keep him quiet?

15
02:08.905 --> 02:10.505
There's more to this than meets the eye.

16
02:11.144 --> 02:12.785
We need to question more than just the craftsmen.

17
02:13.385 --> 02:16.825
Every maid serving Her Ladyship must be questioned, too.

18
02:18.185 --> 02:19.545
I don't know anything!

19
02:19.625 --> 02:20.665
I don't know anything!

20
02:20.745 --> 02:22.745
-I don't know anything! -I'm innocent!

21
02:22.825 --> 02:24.105
I'm innocent!

22
02:26.985 --> 02:30.185
Gejin, you share a room with Chilan.

23
02:30.265 --> 02:32.185
She never came back last night.

24
02:32.705 --> 02:34.105
And you didn't notice?

25
02:34.185 --> 02:37.825
Your Ladyship, Chilan, Siyu, and I share a room.

26
02:38.425 --> 02:40.745
Chilan was supposed to be on night patrol.

27
02:40.825 --> 02:42.185
When I got up last night, she wasn't there.

28
02:42.785 --> 02:45.545
I just assumed she was still on duty.

29
02:45.625 --> 02:47.105
Chilan is very hardworking.

30
02:47.185 --> 02:48.105
Even when she's not on duty,

31
02:48.185 --> 02:51.425
she often goes out alone at night to inspect every corner of the estate.

32
02:51.505 --> 02:53.945
She checks that the tea room stove is out.

33
02:54.025 --> 02:55.865
She's the last to bed and first to rise.

34
02:56.465 --> 02:57.625
But somehow, she…

35
02:57.705 --> 02:59.545
Question all of you together,

36
03:00.385 --> 03:01.545
and we'll find out, won't we?

37
03:02.905 --> 03:04.225
We've gotten to the bottom of it.

38
03:05.425 --> 03:07.305
A bandit had slipped into the estate.

39
03:07.825 --> 03:12.825
He was stealing valuables when Chilan caught him, so he killed her.

40
03:13.625 --> 03:15.065
Just a bandit? That's all?

41
03:15.145 --> 03:16.465
What else could it be?

42
03:17.185 --> 03:18.745
We've taken in so many refugees.

43
03:18.825 --> 03:19.705
All sorts of people have come here.

44
03:20.785 --> 03:23.065
I've ordered the steward to question every refugee.

45
03:23.985 --> 03:25.265
We can't let another thief slip in.

46
03:33.665 --> 03:35.425
You're dismissed.

47
03:41.665 --> 03:42.825
You two may leave as well.

48
03:54.825 --> 03:58.305
Wei Rao, there's something important you need to see tonight.

49
03:59.065 --> 03:59.945
Tonight?

50
04:00.025 --> 04:01.985
Yes. We'll go after dark.

51
04:46.665 --> 04:47.905
They're copper coins.

52
04:47.985 --> 04:52.145
The craftsman named Ben is actually a servant of the Han family.

53
04:52.225 --> 04:54.225
Once the edict came down, the estate changes hands.

54
04:54.305 --> 04:56.305
the Hans only had time to move some of their wealth.

55
04:56.385 --> 04:59.745
He was ordered to stay behind and guard what was left in the vault.

56
04:59.825 --> 05:05.025
Last night, he crawled out of the cellar and ran into Chilan.

57
05:05.105 --> 05:06.345
Afraid she'd discover his secret,

58
05:06.425 --> 05:08.065
he killed her without mercy.

59
05:09.465 --> 05:11.105
The Han family! Again!

60
05:12.065 --> 05:13.225
It was so dark.

61
05:13.305 --> 05:14.425
Chilan might not have seen a thing.

62
05:15.025 --> 05:17.185
But they knew they were guilty.

63
05:17.265 --> 05:20.025
They'd rather kill an innocent than take a chance.

64
05:22.185 --> 05:24.345
And Chilan wasn't his only victim.

65
05:25.105 --> 05:27.945
There are two more bodies buried in the woods southeast of the fields.

66
05:28.025 --> 05:30.665
Seven days ago, a father and son caught him contacting someone outside,

67
05:31.185 --> 05:32.425
so he killed them.

68
05:33.985 --> 05:39.425
If Chilan's body hadn't surfaced, even more innocent people would have died.

69
05:40.505 --> 05:42.705
Zhao Bai. Go see what else is in there.

70
05:47.225 --> 05:48.665
Carry these two chests out first.

71
05:51.385 --> 05:53.745
My Lord, there are over a dozen more chests inside.

72
06:12.585 --> 06:14.705
No wonder Han Liao wouldn't leave us alone.

73
06:16.465 --> 06:17.905
So that's what he was after.

74
06:18.625 --> 06:19.665
What are you going to do with it?

75
06:20.265 --> 06:21.305
Isn't it obvious?

76
06:21.385 --> 06:23.505
We've taken in so many refugees.

77
06:23.585 --> 06:25.025
The court's aid barely covers anything.

78
06:25.745 --> 06:26.825
Clearing new farmland won't feed them right away.

79
06:27.425 --> 06:28.945
We have so many hungry mouths to feed.

80
06:29.625 --> 06:32.065
The Han family's fortune… It was all stolen from the people.

81
06:32.145 --> 06:33.625
What's wrong with giving it back to them?

82
06:34.665 --> 06:37.905
Even if you kept every last coin, would the Han family dare report you?

83
06:38.825 --> 06:40.985
-They'd have to swallow the loss. -Qi Zhongkai.

84
06:41.665 --> 06:42.905
Don't act so noble.

85
06:42.985 --> 06:45.185
Who'd willingly give away a fortune in gold?

86
06:45.265 --> 06:46.865
Only a complete fool!

87
06:48.225 --> 06:49.265
Wei Rao.

88
06:50.905 --> 06:52.585
This money could feed and support your people.

89
06:53.545 --> 06:55.705
Han Liao wouldn't dare openly demand the gold back.

90
06:56.305 --> 06:57.665
But he won't just let it go.

91
06:58.465 --> 07:00.065
If you want to keep this gold,

92
07:02.425 --> 07:03.505
we'll need a clever plan.

93
07:14.105 --> 07:17.425
Move these gold bars out of the cellar in batches.

94
07:18.705 --> 07:20.065
Make sure no outsiders find out.

95
07:21.905 --> 07:24.825
Then seal up the piles of copper coins exactly as they are.

96
07:28.025 --> 07:31.345
So this vault contains only gold and copper coins?

97
07:32.745 --> 07:34.145
Nothing else?

98
07:36.825 --> 07:38.025
What else would there be?

99
07:39.025 --> 07:40.065
We can make sure there will be.

100
07:43.065 --> 07:45.025
Zhao Bai, I need you to do something.

101
07:49.065 --> 07:50.065
Yes, My Lord.

102
07:50.585 --> 07:52.505
What are you two being so mysterious about?

103
07:53.505 --> 07:56.665
There's nothing I love more than gold.

104
07:57.705 --> 07:59.905
Lord Han has given me such a generous gift.

105
08:00.545 --> 08:02.985
It's only right that I return the favor.

106
08:03.625 --> 08:05.105
And the gift I have for him…

107
08:09.345 --> 08:11.265
I hope he can handle it.

108
08:16.185 --> 08:19.745
By the heir's orders, no one may approach the cellar from this day forward!

109
08:19.825 --> 08:21.705
Violators will face military punishment.

110
08:21.785 --> 08:23.105
Yes!

111
08:23.185 --> 08:25.025
What if Her Ladyship finds out?

112
08:25.105 --> 08:27.225
No. I can't stay here any longer.

113
08:30.705 --> 08:32.705
Lady Li heard what happened at my estate.

114
08:33.465 --> 08:35.065
She worried I might be short on reliable help,

115
08:35.985 --> 08:37.225
so she sent Aman to me.

116
08:37.904 --> 08:40.705
From now on, she'll take Chilan's place.

117
08:40.784 --> 08:42.264
You'll all follow her orders.

118
08:43.185 --> 08:44.024
Yes, Your Ladyship.

119
08:45.345 --> 08:46.465
Gejin.

120
08:46.985 --> 08:48.865
Aman is new here.

121
08:48.945 --> 08:49.905
Make sure you show her the ropes.

122
08:50.585 --> 08:51.945
Yes, Your Ladyship.

123
08:52.025 --> 08:54.265
His Majesty is visiting Shanglin Park today.

124
08:54.345 --> 08:55.385
I must go there as well.

125
08:56.265 --> 08:57.265
You all stay and look after the estate.

126
08:57.865 --> 08:59.345
Now, get back to work.

127
08:59.985 --> 09:01.505
-Yes, Your Ladyship. -Yes, Your Ladyship.

128
09:18.185 --> 09:20.065
Your Ladyship, the compensation for Chilan's family

129
09:20.785 --> 09:22.225
has been delivered as you instructed.

130
09:22.785 --> 09:26.025
Aman. I can't trust the people at this estate.

131
09:26.105 --> 09:28.865
There's someone I need you to keep an eye on.

132
09:59.465 --> 10:01.185
I've lost contact with my spy.

133
10:01.865 --> 10:05.425
I trust you can tell me what happened at the estate.

134
10:06.105 --> 10:08.425
Her Ladyship had a craftsman arrested.

135
10:09.545 --> 10:11.385
He… he killed Chilan.

136
10:19.665 --> 10:21.545
Then why are you running?

137
10:28.985 --> 10:30.465
Please don't kill me, My Lord!

138
10:30.545 --> 10:32.425
I'll tell you everything!

139
10:32.505 --> 10:34.505
Tell me everything Her Ladyship has been doing.

140
10:34.585 --> 10:36.545
Don't leave out a single detail.

141
10:39.625 --> 10:42.825
ZHAO

142
10:45.825 --> 10:47.825
That's amazing.

143
10:53.425 --> 10:55.345
-Yes, indeed. -Bravo.

144
10:56.705 --> 10:59.465
-They've got some real tricks! -Good moves!

145
11:00.345 --> 11:01.985
Bravo!

146
11:02.745 --> 11:03.705
-Look at that! -Wow!

147
11:03.785 --> 11:05.785
-That's amazing! -This one's beautiful, too!

148
11:22.625 --> 11:25.785
-Bravo! -Bravo!

149
11:31.265 --> 11:33.585
Such incredible strength! Reward him!

150
11:59.545 --> 12:01.945
-Enemies! -Father!

151
12:02.545 --> 12:05.065
Enemies! Kill!

152
12:05.145 --> 12:06.825
-Your Majesty! -Protect His Majesty!

153
12:07.825 --> 12:08.785
Charge!

154
12:12.745 --> 12:14.625
-Protect His Majesty! -Your Majesty, watch out!

155
12:14.705 --> 12:15.945
-Protect His Majesty! -Protect His Majesty!

156
12:24.625 --> 12:25.785
Mother!

157
12:26.345 --> 12:27.665
Shuo!

158
12:45.785 --> 12:46.985
Go!

159
12:51.265 --> 12:53.305
I failed in my duty. Forgive me for putting you in danger, Your Majesty.

160
13:31.705 --> 13:33.065
It was a test.

161
13:35.385 --> 13:37.225
A test for the princes.

162
13:53.145 --> 13:56.185
FURONG HALL

163
13:56.265 --> 13:59.825
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

164
14:13.305 --> 14:15.665
-Leave us. -Yes, Your Highness.

165
14:18.545 --> 14:22.345
Mother. These are all rewards from Grandmother and Father.

166
14:23.025 --> 14:25.905
But how did you know it was a test?

167
14:25.985 --> 14:27.345
For the past six months,

168
14:27.425 --> 14:30.545
officials have repeatedly urged His Majesty to name a crown prince.

169
14:31.425 --> 14:34.105
Of His Majesty's four sons,

170
14:34.745 --> 14:37.785
Prince Jing was adopted by the Empress.

171
14:38.825 --> 14:40.745
He has the advantage of being the eldest.

172
14:40.825 --> 14:42.825
But when it comes to governing and military strategy,

173
14:43.345 --> 14:44.225
he's nowhere near your equal.

174
14:44.945 --> 14:47.785
Prince Fu has used the Wang family's wealth and influence

175
14:47.865 --> 14:51.105
to win over many court officials who now speak on his behalf.

176
14:52.465 --> 14:55.585
Liu Shuo is the youngest, and he's reckless and unruly.

177
14:56.465 --> 14:59.705
On the surface, he seems the least fit to inherit the throne.

178
15:00.705 --> 15:04.985
But he happens to have a mother who enjoys the Emperor's favor.

179
15:05.585 --> 15:07.905
The court officials can't agree,

180
15:09.345 --> 15:11.945
and His Majesty struggles to decide.

181
15:14.225 --> 15:17.105
Your uncle has been watching closely

182
15:17.185 --> 15:18.265
for unusual activity in the palace and army.

183
15:18.865 --> 15:21.465
He knew His Majesty would put the princes to the test.

184
15:22.425 --> 15:24.465
When I become crown prince,

185
15:24.545 --> 15:26.785
I'll never forget all my grandfather and uncle have done for me.

186
15:30.305 --> 15:31.545
Did you see that clearly?

187
15:31.625 --> 15:34.345
Lady Li had eyes for no one else.

188
15:34.865 --> 15:35.825
She went straight for Liu Shuo?

189
15:38.625 --> 15:41.025
The assassins were after the throne.

190
15:41.705 --> 15:45.305
Liu Shuo was too close to the danger, and Wei Rao was too far away.

191
15:48.745 --> 15:51.025
Then you don't understand people at all.

192
15:51.705 --> 15:53.865
A child abandoned by her mother

193
15:53.945 --> 15:56.425
would never forgive her a second time.

194
15:58.145 --> 16:02.665
It looks like Zhaoyang Palace is in for another family feud.

195
16:06.705 --> 16:09.865
Yes. You're very wise, Mother.

196
16:10.985 --> 16:12.105
Be gentle.

197
16:14.065 --> 16:16.545
Ow! That hurts…

198
16:18.225 --> 16:21.985
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

199
16:22.065 --> 16:22.905
What did His Majesty say?

200
16:23.505 --> 16:25.305
He's ordered that no one be allowed to see him.

201
16:30.345 --> 16:31.505
How is it?

202
16:31.585 --> 16:32.985
Come here. Let Mother have a look.

203
16:33.065 --> 16:34.185
It hurts.

204
16:35.105 --> 16:36.545
His Majesty really went too far.

205
16:36.625 --> 16:39.745
If he wanted to test his sons' character, he should've warned us first.

206
16:40.345 --> 16:41.505
Look what he's put you through.

207
16:42.225 --> 16:43.905
My poor boy!

208
16:43.985 --> 16:45.345
If he'd practiced his fighting skills,

209
16:45.425 --> 16:47.305
he could've been the hero today.

210
16:47.385 --> 16:49.745
Lady Li, you keep spoiling your son

211
16:50.465 --> 16:52.425
without thinking about the trouble ahead.

212
16:53.865 --> 16:55.265
His Majesty refuses to see anyone.

213
16:55.945 --> 16:57.385
He must be upset about what happened.

214
16:57.905 --> 16:59.225
Shuo is still so young.

215
16:59.305 --> 17:01.225
He's your own brother.

216
17:01.305 --> 17:02.625
Instead of worrying about his safety,

217
17:02.705 --> 17:03.785
all you can think about is scheming.

218
17:04.424 --> 17:06.505
Besides, His Majesty deliberately tested them

219
17:06.585 --> 17:08.424
by ordering the guards to lower their defenses.

220
17:08.505 --> 17:10.785
The men they let in were desperate killers.

221
17:10.865 --> 17:12.665
And you still wanted him to play the hero?

222
17:12.745 --> 17:15.105
You might as well wish him dead!

223
17:15.944 --> 17:17.385
You're so petty, Rao.

224
17:17.464 --> 17:18.305
You're just jealous.

225
17:18.385 --> 17:20.865
It was dangerous out there, and you were too far away.

226
17:20.944 --> 17:21.944
How could Mother possibly get to you?

227
17:23.224 --> 17:24.704
If I'd been the one in danger,

228
17:24.785 --> 17:26.985
would Lady Li have left her son to save me?

229
17:38.025 --> 17:39.905
Mother, she resents you.

230
17:39.985 --> 17:41.385
She's never been on our side.

231
17:43.425 --> 17:45.465
What did I do to deserve this?

232
17:46.065 --> 17:49.025
I only scolded Shuo for being lazy and refusing to practice.

233
17:49.105 --> 17:49.945
GREAT BLESSINGS, SPRING'S GRACE

234
17:50.025 --> 17:53.465
She accused me of being petty and resenting my own brother.

235
17:54.825 --> 17:56.705
She abandoned me when I was little.

236
17:56.785 --> 17:58.985
And when danger struck, she forgot about me again.

237
17:59.945 --> 18:01.865
Am I not her own flesh and blood?

238
18:02.785 --> 18:04.345
How can a mother favor one child so much?

239
18:08.905 --> 18:10.305
Rao.

240
18:10.385 --> 18:13.305
Today, His Majesty turned Lady Li away outside Xuanshi Palace.

241
18:14.105 --> 18:16.305
Then the Empress Dowager summoned her for a scolding,

242
18:16.385 --> 18:18.665
accusing her of raising her son poorly.

243
18:19.465 --> 18:21.145
She even said that once the Fourth Prince recovers,

244
18:21.225 --> 18:22.665
he'll be sent to the army for training.

245
18:25.385 --> 18:29.025
Lady Li was just upset, so she took it out on you.

246
18:29.825 --> 18:30.905
He's utterly incompetent!

247
18:33.705 --> 18:36.385
Lady Zheng, you heard her yourself.

248
18:36.905 --> 18:40.425
She blames me for everything Shuo did wrong.

249
18:42.945 --> 18:47.345
Well, Shuo has always lived with his mother.

250
18:47.425 --> 18:50.105
He's still young, so naturally she dotes on him.

251
18:50.785 --> 18:53.745
As his older sister, you'll have to be understanding.

252
18:55.345 --> 18:59.465
It breaks my heart to see a mother and daughter at odds.

253
19:00.345 --> 19:01.505
Here's what we'll do.

254
19:01.585 --> 19:04.305
I'll host a banquet tomorrow and invite Lady Li.

255
19:04.945 --> 19:07.225
I'll help you two make peace.

256
19:08.065 --> 19:09.985
A mother and daughter shouldn't stay angry.

257
19:10.585 --> 19:12.505
Surely talking it out will settle things.

258
19:16.665 --> 19:19.425
Thank you, Lady Zheng.

259
19:23.065 --> 19:25.305
No mother loves all her children equally.

260
19:25.385 --> 19:28.505
The one she raised herself will naturally be her favorite.

261
19:29.265 --> 19:31.185
But she's still your mother.

262
19:31.265 --> 19:34.505
Say a few kind words to her, and she'll come around.

263
19:35.705 --> 19:39.505
Unlike me. Being a royal daughter-in-law isn't easy.

264
19:39.585 --> 19:42.585
I have to watch every word around my mother-in-law.

265
19:43.185 --> 19:44.145
I can't afford a single mistake.

266
19:44.865 --> 19:46.505
When I first married into the family,

267
19:47.145 --> 19:49.385
she looked down on my humble background.

268
19:49.905 --> 19:51.905
I had no powerful father or brothers to support me.

269
19:51.985 --> 19:53.625
She found fault with everything I did.

270
19:54.705 --> 19:56.065
Fortunately, later on…

271
19:56.145 --> 19:57.265
What happened later?

272
20:02.585 --> 20:04.705
Master Min, who makes immortality elixirs for the Empress Dowager,

273
20:04.785 --> 20:05.705
gave me a talisman.

274
20:06.305 --> 20:08.625
It's meant to mend ties between in-laws

275
20:08.705 --> 20:10.305
and keep husbands and wives from arguing.

276
20:11.145 --> 20:12.305
Did it work?

277
20:15.865 --> 20:17.145
You've been separated from your family since childhood.

278
20:17.785 --> 20:18.985
Your family ties have always been fragile.

279
20:19.065 --> 20:22.185
So I got you a talisman to strengthen family bonds.

280
20:22.865 --> 20:24.905
May it help you and your mother reconcile.

281
20:25.745 --> 20:28.025
Life rarely goes the way we want.

282
20:28.105 --> 20:31.785
You need to let go of your resentment and open yourself up to better things.

283
20:32.385 --> 20:34.865
Please don't be stubborn and turn against your mother.

284
20:34.945 --> 20:37.425
She's the one you can truly rely on.

285
20:41.865 --> 20:42.705
I understand.

286
20:45.625 --> 20:46.585
Thank you, Shu.

287
20:49.225 --> 20:50.105
JOY AND PEACE

288
20:59.305 --> 21:00.265
Your Ladyship.

289
21:00.345 --> 21:02.505
Your Ladyship, it's a talisman for family harmony.

290
21:02.585 --> 21:03.705
It's common among folks.

291
21:03.785 --> 21:05.025
Nothing harmful about it.

292
21:07.305 --> 21:08.265
That's a relief.

293
21:09.785 --> 21:12.625
Lady Zheng is hosting a banquet tomorrow. I must go to the palace.

294
21:58.105 --> 22:00.785
Hurry up. Go on.

295
22:45.305 --> 22:48.665
This pair of jade pendants was a gift from His Majesty years ago.

296
22:50.025 --> 22:52.705
I'd like you two cousins to have them.

297
22:52.785 --> 22:54.145
Consider it my way of thanking

298
22:54.225 --> 22:56.625
Princess Consort Duan for helping us reconcile.

299
22:57.345 --> 23:00.305
Lady Li, you're too kind. I don't deserve such praise.

300
23:01.345 --> 23:02.825
Rao is my own cousin.

301
23:02.905 --> 23:04.025
I only want what's best for her.

302
23:04.785 --> 23:07.665
We may have kept Rao's past from others,

303
23:07.745 --> 23:09.665
but there's no hiding it from you two.

304
23:09.745 --> 23:13.025
My daughter was brought back from outside the palace.

305
23:13.105 --> 23:14.945
There are many court rules she doesn't know.

306
23:15.465 --> 23:17.905
I'm grateful Lady Zheng has taken her under her wing.

307
23:17.985 --> 23:19.585
I should be the one thanking you.

308
23:20.265 --> 23:22.945
Actually, I envy you.

309
23:23.705 --> 23:26.425
You have such a bright, thoughtful daughter.

310
23:26.505 --> 23:28.465
Unlike my son.

311
23:28.545 --> 23:31.505
All he ever does is practice fighting.

312
23:32.025 --> 23:33.305
Even on his days off,

313
23:33.945 --> 23:35.905
his father summons him to attend court.

314
23:36.745 --> 23:39.145
All I have is my daughter-in-law to keep me company.

315
23:39.665 --> 23:41.625
As capable as she is,

316
23:42.545 --> 23:44.505
she's no substitute for a loving daughter.

317
23:46.585 --> 23:50.105
Yinggu. Is my gift for Lady Zheng ready?

318
23:50.945 --> 23:51.785
Bring it here at once.

319
23:52.945 --> 23:53.825
Bring it in.

320
23:54.345 --> 23:57.545
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

321
24:01.105 --> 24:02.665
What's all this?

322
24:03.625 --> 24:05.665
Shu, please open it and see.

323
24:24.265 --> 24:25.825
They're here.

324
24:28.305 --> 24:29.625
Rao.

325
24:38.625 --> 24:40.025
All of you, leave!

326
24:45.025 --> 24:47.825
Lady Li, I hosted this banquet out of kindness

327
24:47.905 --> 24:49.265
to help you make peace.

328
24:49.345 --> 24:51.625
And this is how you repay me?

329
24:51.705 --> 24:53.905
Lady Zheng, you've certainly thought of everything.

330
24:54.985 --> 24:57.425
You didn't just help us reconcile.

331
24:57.505 --> 24:59.025
You also had this palace maid

332
24:59.105 --> 25:00.385
sneak into the bedchamber in Zhaoyang Palace

333
25:00.465 --> 25:01.345
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

334
25:01.425 --> 25:03.025
and hide something rather interesting.

335
25:12.105 --> 25:14.105
This is an Enmity Talisman.

336
25:14.825 --> 25:16.785
One must slay a dam and her pups,

337
25:17.385 --> 25:20.065
burn their heads and drink the ashes mixed with water.

338
25:20.145 --> 25:23.585
Bury the pup's bones far apart,

339
25:24.785 --> 25:28.025
so mother and child shall loathe each other for all eternity.

340
25:30.305 --> 25:32.345
It must be a curse against the Empress Dowager and His Majesty.

341
25:33.545 --> 25:34.465
This one is even worse.

342
25:35.385 --> 25:36.705
A Soul-Stealing Talisman.

343
25:37.265 --> 25:38.385
It's meant to take lifes.

344
25:39.585 --> 25:41.785
Whose birth details are written on it?

345
25:42.385 --> 25:43.985
The Empress Dowager's.

346
25:46.705 --> 25:48.065
Lady Zheng.

347
25:48.145 --> 25:50.705
You ordered a palace maid to hide talismans in Zhaoyang Palace.

348
25:50.785 --> 25:54.265
Were you trying to frame Lady Li for practicing forbidden witchcraft?

349
25:54.945 --> 25:56.025
How…

350
25:56.705 --> 25:57.905
How could…

351
25:57.985 --> 25:58.985
How could this happen?

352
26:02.265 --> 26:04.705
You even gave me a Blessing Talisman.

353
26:05.505 --> 26:08.345
So it seems you planned to accuse me

354
26:08.945 --> 26:11.185
for bringing these evil curses into the palace.

355
26:14.025 --> 26:15.025
No, Rao!

356
26:15.865 --> 26:17.545
It wasn't me! I swear!

357
26:19.025 --> 26:20.065
It was Mo…

358
26:25.065 --> 26:26.225
I thought…

359
26:27.585 --> 26:30.465
Rao, I never meant to hurt you.

360
26:40.865 --> 26:42.585
I don't even know this palace maid.

361
26:43.945 --> 26:45.425
You can't pin this on me.

362
26:46.225 --> 26:47.785
Whether you know her doesn't matter.

363
26:48.465 --> 26:50.065
False accusations are as serious as treason.

364
26:50.705 --> 26:52.425
Once I report this to His Majesty,

365
26:52.945 --> 26:54.545
I'll have her sent to the Commandant's Office.

366
26:55.345 --> 26:59.265
There, the ruthless interrogator Boyao will question her personally.

367
26:59.865 --> 27:02.865
I hear Boyao specializes in torture by steaming.

368
27:03.385 --> 27:06.105
Perfect. Let this maid try it first.

369
27:06.745 --> 27:08.185
He can make the blind see,

370
27:08.265 --> 27:11.865
the deaf hear, and even the mute speak.

371
27:14.945 --> 27:15.865
You! Come forward!

372
27:15.945 --> 27:18.265
I was forced into it! I'll tell you everything!

373
27:18.345 --> 27:20.505
Lady Li, please spare my life! Please spare me, Lady Li!

374
27:21.105 --> 27:25.225
Rao. I swear to heaven I never meant you any harm.

375
27:25.825 --> 27:27.025
My mother-in-law only told me

376
27:27.625 --> 27:30.945
that this blessing talisman could help you and your mother reconcile.

377
27:31.665 --> 27:34.545
I thought I'd be doing a good deed.

378
27:34.625 --> 27:36.625
I never imagined it would cause so much trouble.

379
27:36.705 --> 27:37.985
Please believe me, Rao!

380
27:38.065 --> 27:39.865
Why are you crying?

381
27:40.465 --> 27:41.905
You're all spineless cowards!

382
27:43.185 --> 27:44.665
Weren't you going to report me?

383
27:44.745 --> 27:45.665
Go ahead! Do it now!

384
27:46.465 --> 27:49.345
I refuse to believe that some lowly palace maid

385
27:49.425 --> 27:52.305
could bring me down with a few words!

386
27:52.385 --> 27:55.705
The Zheng family is powerful and influential.

387
27:55.785 --> 27:57.785
Lady Zheng is used to getting your way.

388
27:57.865 --> 27:59.465
Who would dare hold you accountable?

389
28:00.185 --> 28:04.785
But right now, His Majesty is about to choose a crown prince.

390
28:05.545 --> 28:07.705
I wonder if the Empress and the Han family

391
28:07.785 --> 28:09.585
will seize this chance to make things worse.

392
28:09.665 --> 28:11.425
And what about Lady Wang and Prince Fu?

393
28:12.025 --> 28:13.985
Will they take advantage of your downfall?

394
28:22.225 --> 28:23.985
You planned all of this.

395
28:31.985 --> 28:33.145
Let's go.

396
28:33.225 --> 28:34.865
Spare me, Your Ladyship!

397
28:35.865 --> 28:37.025
Don't worry, Shu.

398
28:37.785 --> 28:39.545
Lady Li is generous and forgiving.

399
28:40.065 --> 28:42.225
She didn't drag the maid before His Majesty

400
28:42.305 --> 28:44.905
because she cares about Prince Duan's reputation.

401
28:51.425 --> 28:52.305
No wonder.

402
28:53.385 --> 28:55.105
I knew this plan to lure the culprit out

403
28:55.705 --> 28:57.545
wasn't something Lady Li would come up with.

404
28:58.305 --> 29:00.385
Whenever she feels slighted,

405
29:00.465 --> 29:03.825
she runs to His Majesty and acts helpless.

406
29:03.905 --> 29:05.105
She's so used to being spoiled

407
29:06.145 --> 29:08.145
that she'd never hold her anger in for this long.

408
29:09.065 --> 29:12.545
You've certainly outdone your elders.

409
29:13.145 --> 29:16.825
Compared to your mother, you're a little more capable.

410
29:21.345 --> 29:23.545
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

411
29:23.625 --> 29:24.985
You're too kind, Your Ladyship.

412
29:26.025 --> 29:28.705
My younger brother has always been a troublemaker.

413
29:28.785 --> 29:29.785
He's no good at books or fighting.

414
29:30.625 --> 29:31.945
As for the crown prince's position,

415
29:35.145 --> 29:37.665
Prince Duan is clearly the only choice.

416
29:41.465 --> 29:43.745
Lady Li would gladly lend her support.

417
29:43.825 --> 29:44.665
But…

418
29:46.545 --> 29:47.665
But what?

419
29:47.745 --> 29:49.465
The Empress rules over the inner palace.

420
29:50.145 --> 29:52.345
The Han family fully supports Prince Jing,

421
29:52.425 --> 29:54.425
and the Empress Dowager backs him, too.

422
29:54.505 --> 29:56.385
So the crown prince's position…

423
29:56.465 --> 29:57.785
The Empress…

424
29:58.585 --> 30:02.185
Noble Lady Wu'an, you certainly hold a grudge.

425
30:06.545 --> 30:11.225
I wonder, though, what you think, Lady Zheng.

426
30:12.785 --> 30:13.625
I…

427
30:20.625 --> 30:24.425
Of course we should join forces, dear sister.

428
30:34.305 --> 30:37.145
Your cousin is so cunning, yet you saw none of it!

429
30:37.665 --> 30:38.985
You've brought shame upon Mother.

430
30:39.585 --> 30:40.905
Apologize to her at once!

431
30:43.985 --> 30:46.905
It was my carelessness. Please forgive me, Mother.

432
30:46.985 --> 30:48.065
Please forgive me!

433
30:48.985 --> 30:51.705
Enough. Spare your hands.

434
30:53.585 --> 30:56.185
Mother, do you mean we're really going to ally ourselves with them?

435
30:56.785 --> 30:57.905
After they played us for fools?

436
31:01.625 --> 31:02.825
My son is a man of rare talent,

437
31:03.425 --> 31:04.425
truly born to stand above the rest.

438
31:05.025 --> 31:07.385
Who else deserves to be crown prince but you?

439
31:08.585 --> 31:11.345
If I must suffer a little humiliation for your sake,

440
31:11.425 --> 31:12.385
what does it matter?

441
31:13.945 --> 31:17.705
Once you become crown prince, we'll have our chance to settle the score.

442
31:18.705 --> 31:19.705
I knew it.

443
31:20.705 --> 31:23.145
You're the only person in this world who truly cares about me, Mother.

444
31:25.185 --> 31:28.265
As for everyone else, I can't count on them at all.

445
31:30.505 --> 31:33.225
Did Noble Lady Wu'an say what we should do next?

446
31:34.465 --> 31:38.185
They said the Zheng family should hold off for now.

447
31:38.265 --> 31:41.025
Let the court officials recommend Prince Jing as crown prince.

448
31:41.105 --> 31:43.185
Recommend my eldest brother as crown prince?

449
31:43.825 --> 31:44.665
Did she really say that?

450
31:57.505 --> 31:58.425
Keep up. Hurry.

451
32:22.945 --> 32:24.145
Lord Han.

452
32:25.345 --> 32:27.545
They carried seven or eight chests out of the cellar.

453
32:27.625 --> 32:29.025
Every chest was heavy.

454
32:29.105 --> 32:30.425
Aman was there to receive them,

455
32:30.505 --> 32:32.345
and they took everything into the storeroom.

456
32:32.425 --> 32:34.425
-Are you certain? -I saw it myself, my lord.

457
32:34.505 --> 32:35.345
I wouldn't dare lie.

458
32:37.185 --> 32:40.785
I remember Noble Lady Wu'an took in some refugees

459
32:40.865 --> 32:42.305
and earned praise from the court.

460
32:42.905 --> 32:45.185
His Majesty even granted her money and grain from the treasury.

461
32:45.265 --> 32:46.185
That's right.

462
32:47.905 --> 32:50.385
Since I can't get my gold back,

463
32:50.465 --> 32:52.705
I might as well put it to good use.

464
32:55.145 --> 33:00.665
Noble Lady Wu'an, my family's fortune isn't yours for the taking.

465
33:01.585 --> 33:04.305
Lord Han, you promised me yourself

466
33:04.385 --> 33:07.105
that you'd make me your concubine once this was done.

467
33:07.745 --> 33:10.105
I'll serve you faithfully from then on.

468
33:11.585 --> 33:13.625
That depends on

469
33:14.505 --> 33:16.585
how well you carry out your task.

470
33:17.585 --> 33:19.465
I'll do everything I can, My Lord.

471
33:25.465 --> 33:26.305
COMMANDANT'S OFFICE

472
33:26.385 --> 33:29.625
-What's she beating that drum for? -Yeah, what's this about?

473
33:29.705 --> 33:31.105
-What happened to her? -Right.

474
33:31.185 --> 33:32.305
What happened?

475
33:33.945 --> 33:35.625
My lord, that's her.

476
33:37.905 --> 33:40.425
My lord! I wish to accuse Noble Lady Wu'an, Wei Rao,

477
33:40.505 --> 33:42.545
of outrageous greed and stealing relief funds and grain!

478
33:42.625 --> 33:44.665
-How can she do such a thing? -Really? Is she?

479
33:44.745 --> 33:46.745
I knew it. She's skimming off our money.

480
33:46.825 --> 33:48.385
-Exactly! -How awful!

481
33:49.505 --> 33:52.505
Your Majesty, wise rulers have always put the realm's welfare first.

482
33:53.105 --> 33:55.145
They know the succession must come first.

483
33:55.225 --> 33:57.465
A rightful heir gives the people peace of mind.

484
33:57.545 --> 33:59.625
Prince Jing is Your Majesty's eldest son.

485
33:59.705 --> 34:01.705
He is kind, humble, frugal, and devoted to his people.

486
34:02.305 --> 34:05.585
I humbly ask Your Majesty to heed the people's wishes

487
34:05.665 --> 34:07.385
and name Prince Jing crown prince,

488
34:07.465 --> 34:11.065
securing the throne and reassuring the people.

489
34:13.344 --> 34:16.824
Who else among you supports Prince Jing as crown prince?

490
34:16.905 --> 34:20.465
We all support Prince Jing!

491
34:21.625 --> 34:25.385
You mean you advised the Zheng family to stay out of it

492
34:26.145 --> 34:29.744
and let the ministers push for the Empress's son?

493
34:30.425 --> 34:33.105
His Majesty is blessed by heaven and still in his prime.

494
34:33.945 --> 34:35.225
He's in no hurry to name an heir.

495
34:35.905 --> 34:38.945
The harder they push, the angrier he'll become.

496
34:42.865 --> 34:45.385
Naming a crown prince is a matter of great importance.

497
34:45.465 --> 34:47.865
We shall discuss it another day.

498
34:49.665 --> 34:51.065
Do you have anything else to report?

499
34:54.145 --> 34:57.585
Your Majesty, Noble Lady Wu'an is arrogant and overbearing.

500
34:57.665 --> 34:58.585
She abuses her power without restraint.

501
34:58.665 --> 35:00.865
She secretly tortured her maid, Gejin.

502
35:00.945 --> 35:03.185
Covered in wounds, Gejin fled to the Commandant's Office.

503
35:03.265 --> 35:05.145
She publicly accused her mistress

504
35:05.225 --> 35:08.465
of stealing the court's disaster relief funds and grain.

505
35:09.065 --> 35:11.225
Lord Han failed to win Noble Lady Wu'an's hand

506
35:11.305 --> 35:13.065
and was wounded by the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow.

507
35:13.705 --> 35:15.625
He must still hold a grudge.

508
35:15.705 --> 35:16.665
Now, without a shred of evidence,

509
35:17.265 --> 35:18.785
he accuses Her Ladyship of stealing relief supplies.

510
35:19.385 --> 35:21.785
One might suspect he's seeking revenge

511
35:22.385 --> 35:24.305
and question his integrity as an official.

512
35:24.945 --> 35:25.945
Your Majesty.

513
35:26.025 --> 35:28.225
I speak only in the interest of justice, with no personal grudge.

514
35:28.945 --> 35:31.385
Your Majesty granted relief funds to help those in need.

515
35:31.465 --> 35:35.305
If someone truly dared to line their pockets with that money,

516
35:35.905 --> 35:37.865
even a hundred executions wouldn't be enough!

517
35:38.585 --> 35:41.865
Your Majesty, don't believe these baseless accusations!

518
35:41.945 --> 35:43.025
Your Majesty!

519
35:43.105 --> 35:45.105
Hundreds of refugees have gathered at the Commandant's Office,

520
35:45.185 --> 35:46.025
causing an uproar.

521
35:46.705 --> 35:48.465
Rumors are spreading throughout the capital.

522
35:49.065 --> 35:52.225
I request permission to take troops to Zhuyu Estate.

523
35:52.305 --> 35:54.425
If Noble Lady Wu'an is truly innocent,

524
35:54.505 --> 35:59.225
we can clear her name before everyone and put the people at ease.

525
36:01.745 --> 36:03.145
Qi Zhongkai.

526
36:03.225 --> 36:05.105
Take troops with Han Liao and accompany the Commandant

527
36:05.185 --> 36:06.425
to investigate this matter.

528
36:07.025 --> 36:08.065
As you command.

529
36:14.905 --> 36:17.305
ZHUYU ESTATE

530
36:20.065 --> 36:20.905
It's all in there.

531
36:20.985 --> 36:22.785
I saw it with my own eyes.

532
36:22.865 --> 36:26.345
They exchanged the stolen relief funds and grain for gold bars.

533
36:26.425 --> 36:28.585
You shameless wretch.

534
36:28.665 --> 36:29.625
Her Ladyship has always treated you well.

535
36:30.225 --> 36:31.905
How dare you betray her and falsely accuse your mistress?

536
36:33.145 --> 36:36.385
Whether I am telling the truth will be clear once we open the storeroom.

537
36:37.545 --> 36:38.905
Her Ladyship receives only a modest allowance.

538
36:39.505 --> 36:41.225
How could she have a treasury?

539
36:41.305 --> 36:44.265
My lord. There's a whole mountain of coins inside.

540
36:44.905 --> 36:45.945
Break it open!

541
36:50.225 --> 36:51.865
Do you think the people will believe

542
36:52.465 --> 36:57.145
that the kind and generous Noble Lady Wu'an is innocent?

543
36:57.225 --> 36:58.585
No one will believe her now.

544
37:00.025 --> 37:02.105
From now on, every coin in her storeroom

545
37:02.185 --> 37:04.185
will be seen as wealth wrung from the poor,

546
37:04.785 --> 37:06.225
stolen from disaster relief funds.

547
37:06.305 --> 37:10.505
Her spotless reputation will be stained beyond repair.

548
37:11.385 --> 37:15.545
And this refuge she worked so hard and sacrificed so much to build

549
37:16.465 --> 37:19.985
will be destroyed by vicious rumors and reduced to nothing in an instant.

550
37:20.865 --> 37:23.625
All because of that gold and money,

551
37:24.825 --> 37:27.185
she'll lose the people's trust and become a public enemy.

552
37:27.785 --> 37:28.905
Han Liao.

553
37:29.585 --> 37:31.425
How utterly despicable you are.

554
37:32.385 --> 37:33.265
And how cruel.

555
37:34.745 --> 37:36.385
The refugees have nowhere else to go.

556
37:36.945 --> 37:38.865
And you want to destroy their only home!

557
37:38.945 --> 37:40.385
You see right through me.

558
37:41.105 --> 37:42.625
Just what I'd expect from Lord Lu.

559
37:43.225 --> 37:45.065
She has only herself to blame for rejecting me

560
37:45.145 --> 37:48.345
-and wasting my sincere affection! -You shameless

561
37:48.425 --> 37:49.945
despicable cur!

562
37:50.545 --> 37:54.745
What a cur can't have, he'll destroy completely!

563
37:55.345 --> 37:56.505
Found it! We found it!

564
38:09.345 --> 38:11.585
Lord Commandant, take a look.

565
38:12.425 --> 38:15.625
Everyone here, come and see for yourselves!

566
38:17.825 --> 38:19.225
Look at this Noble Lady Wu'an,

567
38:19.305 --> 38:21.585
so kind to the poor and elderly, practically a saint!

568
38:22.185 --> 38:24.945
See how much she's stolen from the people!

569
38:56.785 --> 38:57.785
Look closely.

570
38:58.545 --> 39:00.825
Are these gold bars or copper coins?

571
39:01.345 --> 39:02.465
You scoundrel, Han.

572
39:03.345 --> 39:05.705
Is this the fortune you claim she stole from the people?

573
39:18.225 --> 39:20.305
Open it! Open every last one!

574
39:30.465 --> 39:32.945
Noble Lady Wu'an, what… What are these?

575
39:33.545 --> 39:35.025
Winters are long and bitterly cold.

576
39:35.745 --> 39:37.545
The refugees don't have enough warm clothing.

577
39:37.625 --> 39:39.825
Noble Lady Wu'an entrusted Princess Consort Duan

578
39:39.905 --> 39:41.545
to collect those from noble households.

579
39:42.345 --> 39:45.545
The ladies also generously donated old jewelry, antiques, and ornaments.

580
39:46.145 --> 39:49.825
The stolen goods aren't in the storeroom because you knew we were coming!

581
39:50.425 --> 39:52.465
My men have been guarding the estate's entrance.

582
39:53.065 --> 39:55.425
There's no way you could've taken the money out.

583
39:55.505 --> 39:57.465
Search the whole estate, and we'll find it.

584
39:58.505 --> 40:00.185
Search! Keep searching!

585
40:01.465 --> 40:02.305
Lord Bo.

586
40:07.145 --> 40:08.705
I found a cellar.

587
40:08.785 --> 40:10.145
There's a secret passage inside.

588
40:16.825 --> 40:17.905
Everyone, follow me!

589
40:20.265 --> 40:21.385
This way, please.

590
40:39.745 --> 40:43.185
Wei Rao, you may have hidden or moved the gold,

591
40:43.705 --> 40:46.185
but could you move an entire mountain of copper coins?

592
40:47.145 --> 40:48.065
Noble Lady Wu'an,

593
40:48.705 --> 40:50.385
what do you have to say for yourself?

594
40:50.465 --> 40:51.905
With your modest allowance,

595
40:51.985 --> 40:53.665
how could you possibly amass such a fortune?

596
40:54.505 --> 40:57.185
There's a treasury beneath the estate's cellar?

597
40:58.865 --> 40:59.785
I truly knew nothing about it.

598
41:00.545 --> 41:01.785
My lord, don't believe her.

599
41:02.465 --> 41:04.905
Her Ladyship ordered the cellar to be dug.

600
41:04.985 --> 41:08.305
The relief funds and grain she stole were all hidden down there.

601
41:08.385 --> 41:11.185
That mountain of copper coins is proof of her crimes.

602
41:19.705 --> 41:21.785
Lord Bo, while we were digging,

603
41:21.865 --> 41:23.545
our shovels struck something that sounded hollow.

604
41:23.625 --> 41:26.745
I had the men move the pile of coins and dig deeper.

605
41:26.825 --> 41:28.705
We found another chamber, hidden extremely well.

606
41:29.305 --> 41:32.185
Inside were 120 suits of armor.

607
41:36.145 --> 41:37.825
Armor hidden beneath the cellar?

608
41:38.625 --> 41:41.065
Noble Lady Wu'an, nobles may keep private guards

609
41:41.145 --> 41:43.425
to manage estates and maintain order.

610
41:43.505 --> 41:46.145
In wartime, they must also fight for the realm.

611
41:46.825 --> 41:48.385
But the court has long forbidden

612
41:48.465 --> 41:50.985
the private manufacture or sale of armor and shields.

613
41:51.065 --> 41:53.705
Possessing just five suits of armor is punishable by hanging.

614
41:53.785 --> 41:56.785
This is high treason!

615
41:58.145 --> 41:59.145
What armor?

616
42:00.425 --> 42:03.425
I didn't even know there was a treasury beneath the cellar.

617
42:03.505 --> 42:05.345
How could I be plotting treason?

618
42:05.425 --> 42:06.705
I'm just a woman.

619
42:06.785 --> 42:09.065
Why would I rebel? What rebellion?

620
42:10.385 --> 42:12.345
Lord Lu, General Qi,

621
42:12.425 --> 42:14.305
you must testify on my behalf!

622
42:14.385 --> 42:15.305
I've been falsely accused!

623
42:21.665 --> 42:25.385
Han Liao. This is fish-scale armor laced with iron and bronze fittings.

624
42:26.265 --> 42:28.305
It even bears your family's crest.

625
42:28.385 --> 42:30.585
This estate once belonged to you.

626
42:31.185 --> 42:34.585
The one plotting treason is clearly you.

627
42:35.225 --> 42:36.185
You've framed me!

628
42:38.225 --> 42:39.745
Seize this traitor at once!

629
42:44.025 --> 42:46.865
I've always been loyal to His Majesty. It's you!

630
42:47.665 --> 42:49.905
You've conspired to frame me!

631
42:50.545 --> 42:53.025
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

632
42:53.625 --> 42:55.585
I… The Han family deceived me.

633
42:55.665 --> 42:56.625
Please, Your Ladyship,

634
42:56.705 --> 42:59.825
for the sake of the years I've served you, spare my life!

635
43:00.505 --> 43:05.105
Before Chilan died, do you think she was also praying

636
43:06.105 --> 43:07.825
that her killer would spare her life?

637
43:08.625 --> 43:10.225
Your life matters,

638
43:11.545 --> 43:13.705
but Chilan deserved to die?

639
43:13.785 --> 43:16.345
You betrayed your mistress. You shameless wretch.

640
43:16.425 --> 43:18.025
How dare you beg for mercy?

641
43:18.785 --> 43:20.625
Your Ladyship, I know I was wrong!

642
43:20.705 --> 43:21.945
I don't want to die!

643
43:22.025 --> 43:23.225
Please spare my life, Your Ladyship!

644
43:23.305 --> 43:24.425
Seize her!

645
43:24.505 --> 43:26.345
Your Ladyship, please spare me!

646
43:26.425 --> 43:28.425
Your Ladyship! I don't want to die!

647
43:28.505 --> 43:30.385
-Save those words… -Please spare me, Your Ladyship!

648
43:30.465 --> 43:32.585
And explain yourself to Chilan in the afterlife.

649
43:33.985 --> 43:35.225
This case is extremely serious.

650
43:35.305 --> 43:37.985
His Majesty may wish to question you himself.

651
43:38.065 --> 43:41.505
Noble Lady Wu'an, please accompany us to the Commandant's Office.

652
43:42.785 --> 43:43.865
Rest assured.

653
43:44.665 --> 43:46.985
Everyone knows Lord Bo upholds the law without favor.

654
43:47.785 --> 43:48.905
He never favors nobles or imperial relatives.

655
43:49.505 --> 43:50.985
I'm sure he'll judge this case fairly.

656
43:53.105 --> 43:56.025
-Lord Bo, I'll go with you. -This way, Your Ladyship.

657
44:05.385 --> 44:08.585
Looks like Han Liao has finally fallen into his own trap.

658
44:08.665 --> 44:10.785
He got what he deserved!

659
44:10.865 --> 44:12.425
Don't celebrate just yet.

660
44:12.505 --> 44:14.665
The Han family won't go down so easily.

661
44:16.505 --> 44:18.385
We still have a tough fight ahead.

662
44:21.185 --> 44:23.985
Mother kindly tried to arrange a marriage for Noble Lady Wu'an,

663
44:24.505 --> 44:26.345
yet she had the nerve to reject it.

664
44:28.465 --> 44:33.025
Raised by that nursemaid's daughter, she was born lowly.

665
44:33.105 --> 44:34.185
She doesn't know what's good for her.

666
44:34.785 --> 44:35.825
Don't worry, Mother.

667
44:36.345 --> 44:38.145
Once I become crown prince,

668
44:38.225 --> 44:40.385
I'll deal with that mother and daughter.

669
44:41.145 --> 44:42.945
Your father is still alive.

670
44:43.785 --> 44:45.425
Even if you become crown prince,

671
44:46.105 --> 44:49.105
what can you do to those two witches?

672
44:49.185 --> 44:50.985
They say the Emperor will live forever.

673
44:51.585 --> 44:54.185
But no emperor can truly live for thousands of years.

674
44:55.465 --> 44:58.705
Father will grow old eventually.

675
44:58.785 --> 45:01.585
I may be Empress and mother of the realm,

676
45:01.665 --> 45:03.345
but all these years,

677
45:03.865 --> 45:06.065
His Majesty has always favored Lady Zhou.

678
45:06.145 --> 45:07.825
I've endured so much ridicule because of it.

679
45:08.545 --> 45:09.825
One day,

680
45:09.905 --> 45:10.905
GRACIOUS BLESSINGS

681
45:10.985 --> 45:13.665
when our time finally comes,

682
45:15.185 --> 45:17.785
I'll strip her of her fine clothes and jewelry.

683
45:17.865 --> 45:19.585
You'd better make me proud.

684
45:24.825 --> 45:27.785
These are all gifts the ministers have sent me.

685
45:28.465 --> 45:30.905
It's clear who the court supports.

686
45:31.785 --> 45:34.025
Your wish will soon come true, Mother.

687
45:34.785 --> 45:40.625
As for Noble Lady Wu'an, I have a way to avenge you right now.

688
45:41.225 --> 45:42.985
Doesn't she love taking in refugees?

689
45:43.905 --> 45:47.065
I hear leprosy is spreading through a village in Beihan.

690
45:48.345 --> 45:49.825
One little mistake,

691
45:50.705 --> 45:52.865
and she'll be covered in festering sores.

692
45:53.425 --> 45:57.025
That filthy, stinking refugee camp will have to be burned to the ground!

693
46:00.905 --> 46:03.585
Think carefully before you make your move, dear sister.

694
46:11.705 --> 46:13.065
I won! I won!

695
46:13.665 --> 46:15.705
Lady Zheng, luck is on your side today.

696
46:15.785 --> 46:18.225
It seems your wishes are about to come true.

697
46:18.825 --> 46:21.625
I can't match your beauty, dear sister,

698
46:21.705 --> 46:23.265
or your endless favor with His Majesty.

699
46:24.105 --> 46:26.825
Fortunately, I have a son I can rely on.

700
46:27.545 --> 46:29.465
Heaven has blessed me in that regard.

701
46:33.505 --> 46:36.265
Mother. Everything is arranged.

702
46:42.745 --> 46:43.865
JIAOFANG PALACE

703
46:43.945 --> 46:45.785
Your Majesty, Your Highness! Look at the sky!

704
46:45.865 --> 46:47.105
A heavenly omen has appeared!

705
46:50.465 --> 46:53.385
Your Majesty, cranes have arrived in this age of peace!

706
46:53.465 --> 46:55.505
Surely this is a sign of great fortune!

707
46:55.585 --> 46:57.625
Your Majesty's kindness and Prince Jing's wisdom

708
46:57.705 --> 46:59.425
have earned heaven's favor and brought this blessing!

709
47:00.785 --> 47:04.785
Congratulations, Your Majesty and Your Highness!

710
47:05.385 --> 47:07.625
I've prayed every day

711
47:07.705 --> 47:09.985
for peace and prosperity throughout the realm!

712
47:10.065 --> 47:13.945
Heaven has finally heard my prayers and sent us this wonderful sign!

713
47:14.545 --> 47:16.065
Hurry! Tell His Majesty!

714
47:16.145 --> 47:18.265
No. This is a blessing from heaven.

715
47:18.865 --> 47:20.865
I'll bring Father the good news myself!

716
47:20.945 --> 47:23.305
JIAOFANG PALACE

717
47:23.985 --> 47:26.785
Could my lifelong wish finally be coming true?

718
47:31.865 --> 47:33.865
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

719
47:34.945 --> 47:38.505
Lu Zhuo and Noble Lady Wu'an planted false evidence to frame me!

720
47:39.545 --> 47:42.785
I wouldn't dare hide armor illegally, no matter how bold I was!

721
47:42.865 --> 47:45.345
-That cellar was… -Dug by your Han family exactly!

722
47:48.865 --> 47:49.865
Your Majesty!

723
47:50.665 --> 47:52.585
That treasury was extremely well hidden,

724
47:53.265 --> 47:54.745
buried two to three zhang underground.

725
47:54.825 --> 47:57.465
Its walls were lined with straw to keep out moisture

726
47:58.025 --> 47:59.265
and coated with tung oil.

727
47:59.945 --> 48:02.425
A cellar that large would need an enormous amount of tung oil.

728
48:02.505 --> 48:04.305
No one could gather that much in just a few months.

729
48:04.385 --> 48:07.225
My estate can barely afford enough food for winter.

730
48:07.305 --> 48:08.985
How could I possibly afford such a project?

731
48:11.145 --> 48:12.025
Marquis of Xiting.

732
48:13.665 --> 48:15.385
You disgraceful son!

733
48:15.465 --> 48:17.785
Our family dug that cellar!

734
48:17.865 --> 48:19.585
How dare you deny it before His Majesty?

735
48:19.665 --> 48:21.265
Be quiet!

736
48:22.425 --> 48:23.945
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

737
48:24.025 --> 48:25.825
My unworthy son abused his office

738
48:26.425 --> 48:28.985
to exploit others for profit and secretly amassed a fortune.

739
48:29.065 --> 48:30.505
That alone is a serious crime.

740
48:30.585 --> 48:33.545
Then he quarreled with Noble Lady Wu'an, bribed her maid,

741
48:34.145 --> 48:35.505
and framed an innocent woman.

742
48:35.585 --> 48:38.825
I failed to raise him properly, and I'm deeply ashamed.

743
48:38.905 --> 48:43.625
I'm willing to surrender my title and retire to atone for his crimes!

744
48:44.785 --> 48:46.705
He hid armor and plotted rebellion.

745
48:47.505 --> 48:49.185
Losing the title won't make up for that.

746
48:49.265 --> 48:50.385
You…

747
48:50.465 --> 48:51.945
Marquis of Xiting, do the laws of this realm mean nothing to you?

748
48:52.545 --> 48:53.425
Your Majesty!

749
48:53.505 --> 48:55.465
The hidden treasury is real,

750
48:55.545 --> 48:57.065
but the armor accusation is completely false!

751
48:57.905 --> 49:02.105
Noble Lady Wu'an learned the treasury's location from the workers

752
49:02.705 --> 49:05.145
and deliberately set a trap for me.

753
49:05.225 --> 49:08.585
They planted that armor themselves!

754
49:08.665 --> 49:10.025
The estate is short on everything.

755
49:10.105 --> 49:13.705
If I'd found a fortune, I'd have claimed it for myself.

756
49:14.225 --> 49:15.545
Would I sit idle and await your accusation?

757
49:16.145 --> 49:17.985
You already got your hands on the gold.

758
49:19.065 --> 49:20.225
You hid gold, too?

759
49:21.345 --> 49:23.865
Where? I haven't seen any.

760
49:24.665 --> 49:26.025
You!

761
49:26.105 --> 49:27.625
The armor was hidden extremely well.

762
49:28.225 --> 49:29.705
No ordinary person could've found it.

763
49:31.505 --> 49:33.865
Lord Han tried to turn things around

764
49:34.625 --> 49:36.625
by framing Her Ladyship so he can reclaim the cellar.

765
49:37.505 --> 49:40.145
But we followed the clues and dug up the armor.

766
49:40.825 --> 49:41.945
I'd say

767
49:44.025 --> 49:45.145
you brought this on yourself.

768
49:45.225 --> 49:46.705
Lu Zhuo.

769
49:48.225 --> 49:51.505
You're framing a loyal official over a personal grudge!

770
50:13.785 --> 50:14.785
Loyal?

771
50:16.265 --> 50:19.225
What loyal servant has mountains of gold?

772
50:20.145 --> 50:24.065
What decent official robs the poor and lives off their taxes?

773
50:24.665 --> 50:26.905
You've betrayed your Emperor and your people.

774
50:26.985 --> 50:28.025
Han Liao!

775
50:28.625 --> 50:30.705
-You deserve to die a thousand deaths! -Your Majesty!

776
50:30.785 --> 50:34.985
The Lu family is clearly seeking revenge and eliminating their rivals!

777
50:35.065 --> 50:36.105
Enough!

778
50:36.705 --> 50:38.625
You both tell different stories.

779
50:38.705 --> 50:41.065
How am I supposed to decide?

780
50:43.585 --> 50:45.345
His Highness Prince Jing has arrived!

781
50:52.385 --> 50:55.145
Father, your wisdom and blessings know no bounds.

782
50:55.825 --> 50:57.585
Just now, heavenly music filled the air,

783
50:57.665 --> 50:59.145
and cranes descended from the sky.

784
50:59.225 --> 51:00.785
Above the Jiaofang Palace,

785
51:00.865 --> 51:03.105
they danced and sang, circling endlessly.

786
51:03.185 --> 51:04.945
Such an omen is seen once in a century.

787
51:05.545 --> 51:08.385
It signals wise leadership and an era of peace and prosperity!

788
51:09.065 --> 51:12.945
You say a divine omen appeared. Where?

789
51:13.025 --> 51:13.865
Above the Jiaofang Palace.

790
51:13.945 --> 51:16.745
The sacred cranes are a blessing upon our dynasty.

791
51:16.825 --> 51:19.145
Heaven has also blessed Her Majesty the Empress.

792
51:19.225 --> 51:21.425
Everyone in the palace witnessed it.

793
51:21.505 --> 51:23.945
It's a tribute to Mother's virtue and kindness to all!

794
51:26.665 --> 51:29.025
It's Heaven rewarding the Empress's virtue,

795
51:29.105 --> 51:31.545
or praising you as our wise future Crown Prince?

796
51:32.985 --> 51:36.025
I'm unworthy. I'd never covet the throne.

797
51:36.105 --> 51:38.585
I got carried away. Please forgive me, Father.

798
51:38.665 --> 51:39.785
What?

799
51:40.585 --> 51:43.745
Your Han family hid armor and staged a divine omen

800
51:44.345 --> 51:45.945
just to put him on the throne?

801
51:46.025 --> 51:47.105
-Your Majesty! -Father!

802
51:47.185 --> 51:48.465
-I'm innocent! -I would never dare!

803
51:49.065 --> 51:50.025
Guards!

804
51:50.105 --> 51:52.105
Strip Prince Jing of his royal robes!

805
51:52.785 --> 51:54.225
Throw him in the Commandant's prison

806
51:55.025 --> 51:56.745
along with the Marquis of Xiting and his son.

807
51:57.385 --> 51:59.265
Have Boyao detain and interrogate them!

808
51:59.865 --> 52:01.785
Confine the Empress to her Jiaofang Palace!

809
52:02.385 --> 52:04.385
No one is to be released without my order!

810
52:04.465 --> 52:06.825
Father, I'm innocent!

811
52:07.345 --> 52:08.665
I've been framed, Father!

812
52:09.345 --> 52:11.385
Father, I… I'm innocent!

813
52:11.465 --> 52:13.305
I'm innocent!

814
52:14.425 --> 52:15.945
-Father! -Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

815
52:16.025 --> 52:18.065
I'm innocent, Father!

816
52:19.465 --> 52:20.865
Father!

817
54:35.705 --> 54:38.265
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
